---
import { Wine, Sparkles, Heart, ShieldAlert, Palette, ShieldCheck, Mail } from 'lucide-react';
---

<footer class="w-full bg-obsidian-950 border-t border-gold-500/20 py-12 sm:py-16 text-slate-400 text-xs">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 mb-12">
      
      <!-- Col 1: Brand & Slogan -->
      <div class="space-y-4 md:col-span-1">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <Wine class="w-5 h-5 text-gold-400" />
          <span class="text-base font-serif font-bold text-slate-100 tracking-wider">
            ELIXIR & SHADOW
          </span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          在光影与烈酒的交汇处，调制灵魂解药。为全层级调酒爱好者与专业吧台从业者打造的专业鸡尾酒知识库与配方大全。
        </p>
        <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">
          收录 IBA 国际调酒师协会标准酒谱 · TheCocktailDB 国际扩展
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 2: Navigation Links -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-gold-400">板块直达</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs">
          <li><a href="/recipes" class="hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors">经典配方查询</a></li>
          <li><a href="/my-bar" class="hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors">我的吧台 (材料反查)</a></li>
          <li><a href="/masters" class="hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors">大师专区 (IBA三大系列)</a></li>
          <li><a href="/competitions" class="hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors">世界大赛冠军作品</a></li>
          <li><a href="/themes" class="hover:text-gold-300 text-gold-400 font-semibold transition-colors flex items-center gap-1">🎨 5大美学主题工坊</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 3: Encyclopedia & Learning -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-gold-400">百科与学堂</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs">
          <li><a href="/ingredients" class="hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors">六大基酒与辅料百科</a></li>
          <li><a href="/academy" class="hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors">调酒工具使用指南</a></li>
          <li><a href="/academy#techniques" class="hover:text-gold-300 transition-colors">7大调酒手法详解 (Shake/Stir)</a></li>
          <li><a href="/about" class="hover:text-gold-300 text-gold-400/90 transition-colors flex items-center gap-1">
            <span>关于影之甘露 · 平台理念</span>
          </a></li>
          <li><a href="/about#commercial-partnership" class="hover:text-gold-300 text-gold-400 font-semibold transition-colors flex items-center gap-1">
            <span>💼 商业合作与品牌共创</span>
          </a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 4: Business Contact & Responsible Drinking -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-obsidian-900 border border-gold-500/20 space-y-2.5">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-gold-400 font-semibold text-xs">
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <Mail class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
              <span>商务合作 &amp; 联系站长</span>
            </span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 leading-snug">
            支持酒企品牌入驻、酒吧定制酒单、线下特调沙龙及数据合作
          </p>
          <button
            data-contact-trigger
            class="w-full py-1.5 px-3 rounded-lg bg-gold-500 hover:bg-gold-400 text-obsidian-950 font-bold text-xs flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 transition-all shadow-sm active:scale-95 cursor-pointer"
          >
            <span>💬 立即联系 / 合作洽谈</span>
          </button>
        </div>

        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-obsidian-900/60 border border-white/5 space-y-1">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-amber-400 font-semibold text-[11px]">
            <ShieldAlert class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
            <span>理性饮酒倡议</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
            未成年人禁止饮酒。酒后请勿驾车。孕妇与哺乳期妇女请勿饮酒。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    {/* Legal & Image Attribution Notice */}
    <div class="pt-6 border-t border-white/5 space-y-2 text-[11px] text-slate-400">
      <p class="leading-relaxed">
        <strong class="text-slate-300">知识产权、合理使用与合规通道：</strong>
        本站为非商业性质的调酒文化与数字化配方研究项目。所有酒品摄影与纹理均遵循合法授权：氛围实拍与材质来自 <a href="https://unsplash.com/license" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-gold-400/80 hover:underline">Unsplash License (商业与非商业免费授权)</a>，经典酒谱与配料图承蒙 <a href="https://www.thecocktaildb.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-gold-400/80 hover:underline">TheCocktailDB 开放数据库</a> 与 <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-gold-400/80 hover:underline">Wikimedia Commons (CC-BY-SA / Public Domain)</a> 开源授权支持。
      </p>
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
        所有提及的注册商标与赛事品牌归其合法所有人所有，引用仅作客观文化与配方事实记录。若有任何版权疑问，欢迎通过 <a href="/about#ip-compliance" class="text-gold-400 hover:underline inline-flex items-center gap-0.5">【知识产权申诉通道】</a> 与我们联系，我们将在核实后第一时间处理。
      </p>
      <!-- 饮酒年龄合规声明（中国法律要求） -->
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-slate-500">
        ⚠️ <strong class="text-slate-400">法律声明：</strong>本平台内容仅面向已达中国法定饮酒年龄（18 周岁及以上）的成年人。<strong>禁止向未成年人销售或提供含酒精饮品。</strong>未成年人请在监护人陪同下浏览，本站不承担因未成年人浏览引发的任何法律责任。
      </p>
    </div>

    {/* Copyright & ICP Filing */}
    <div class="pt-6 mt-4 border-t border-white/5 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-[11px] text-slate-400">
      <div>
        © {new Date().getFullYear()} Elixir &amp; Shadow (影之甘露). All rights reserved.
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-3 sm:gap-4 text-center">
        <span>非商业文化研究 · 纯享灵感 · 合规开放</span>
        <!-- ICP 备案号：获取备案号后将下方内容替换为实际备案号 -->
        <a
          href="https://beian.miit.gov.cn/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-300 transition-colors"
        >
          沪ICP备XXXXXXXX号-1
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
